{"ready":true,"data":{"id":"josie-totah","name":"Josie Totah","birthDate":"2001-08-05","birthPlace":"Sacramento, California, USA","bio":"Josie Totah (born August 5, 2001), formerly known as J. J. Totah, is an American actress. She is known for her recurring role on the Disney Channel series Jessie and supporting role on the 2013 ABC comedy series Back in the Game. Totah received critical praise for her role in the 2016 film Other People. In 2018, she starred in the short-lived NBC comedy series Champions.\n\nDescription above from the Wikipedia article Josie Totah, licensed under CC-BY-SA, full list of contributors on Wikipedia.","source":"TMDB","fetchedAt":"2026-11-16T12:22:31+00:00","tmdbId":1520451,"sourceUrl":"https://www.themoviedb.org/person/1520451","credits":[{"id":"spider-home","title":"Spider-Man: Homecoming","character":"Seymour"}],"photo":"./public-data/images/people/josie-totah.webp","filmography":[{"name":"Faces of Death","year":2026,"character":"Samantha Gravinsky","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/jdbFKRF9pWUY7aFUk19ys4zHoBV.jpg"},{"name":"Carrie","year":2026,"character":"Tina Blake","mediaType":"tv","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/6mUMquPQBFJGqTACS3Azkwwrx8d.jpg"},{"name":"Codependent","year":2026,"character":"","mediaType":"tv","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/677wu93Pd4gZDugT9N6wJzmj9fH.jpg"},{"name":"The Buccaneers","year":2023,"character":"Mabel Elmsworth","mediaType":"tv","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/vbbZRlzz41JQjBOT9OEKHgonhZ3.jpg"},{"name":"Human Resources","year":2022,"character":"Natalie (voice)","mediaType":"tv","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/9uEmYSgYIMBEIN82VAlqZnatpxJ.jpg"},{"name":"Moxie","year":2021,"character":"CJ","mediaType":"movie","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/aLBo1Ca9PggcWY98ItW5ZkdxTuA.jpg"},{"name":"Turning the Tables with Robin Roberts","year":2021,"character":"Self","mediaType":"tv","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/huuPZ8L0fzgYTCwcXajZ